      "title": "由两个线性形式确定柱面母线方向",
      "stem": "方程\n$$f(x+y+z,\\,2x-3y)=0$$\n表示空间中的一个柱面。求其母线的单位方向向量。",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 2,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "$\\displaystyle \\pm\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{38}}(3,2,-5)$",
