              "order": 2,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "解 $a+b+c=0$、$2a-3b=0$，取方向 $(3,2,-5)$。",
              "method_code": "common_null_direction"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "除以 $\\sqrt{38}$ 得单位方向。"
