      "title": "与两直线相交且平行于平面的动直线轨迹",
      "stem": "给定平面 $\\Sigma:x+y+1=0$。求所有平行于 $\\Sigma$，且同时与\n$$L_1:\\frac{x-2}{1}=\\frac{y+3}{2}=\\frac{z-5}{1},\\qquad L_2:\\frac{x}{1}=\\frac{y-2}{2}=\\frac{z+1}{0}$$\n相交的动直线所形成的曲面方程。",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 3,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "$(2x-y+2)(x+y+19)-27(z+1)=0$",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "参数化交点并消元",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "设交点 $P(s)=(2+s,-3+2s,5+s)\\in L_1$、$Q(t)=(t,2+2t,-1)\\in L_2$。连线平行于 $\\Sigma$ 等价于 $(Q-P)\\cdot(1,1,0)=0$，得 $s=t+1$。动直线可参数化为 $(x,y,z)=Q(t)+\\lambda(P(t+1)-Q(t))$，即 $x=t+3\\lambda$、$y=2+2t-3\\lambda$、$z=-1+\\lambda(t+7)$。由前两式得 $t=(x+y-2)/3$、$\\lambda=(2x-y+2)/9$，代入第三式即得答案。",
          "main_method_code": "parameter_elimination",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "参数化动直线在 $L_1,L_2$ 上的两个交点。"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "用方向向量与平面法向量正交，求得两交点参数关系 $s=t+1$。"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "写出动直线的双参数方程。"
            },
            {
              "order": 4,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "消去 $t,\\lambda$ 得隐式曲面方程。",
              "method_code": "parameter_elimination"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
