      "title": "正交坐标变换化二次曲面为标准形",
      "stem": "已知二次曲面\n$$2x^2+5y^2+5z^2+4xy-4xz-8yz-9=0.$$\n使用直角坐标变换将其化为标准方程，并判断曲面类型；要求写出坐标变换及其求法。",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 3,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "可取\n$$T=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac2{\\sqrt5}&\\frac2{3\\sqrt5}&-\\frac13\\\\-\\frac1{\\sqrt5}&\\frac4{3\\sqrt5}&-\\frac23\\\\0&\\frac5{3\\sqrt5}&\\frac23\\end{pmatrix},\\quad \\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=T\\begin{pmatrix}\\xi\\\\\\eta\\\\\\zeta\\end{pmatrix}.$$\n标准形为 $\\xi^2+\\eta^2+10\\zeta^2=9$，即椭球面。",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "对二次型矩阵作正交对角化",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "二次项矩阵为 $M=\\begin{pmatrix}2&2&-2\\\\2&5&-4\\\\-2&-4&5\\end{pmatrix}$，其特征值为 $1,1,10$。可取对应的两两正交特征向量 $(2,-1,0)^T$、$(2,4,5)^T$、$(-1,-2,2)^T$，单位化后作为 $T$ 的列。于是 $T^TMT=\\operatorname{diag}(1,1,10)$，代换 $X=T(\\xi,\\eta,\\zeta)^T$ 得 $\\xi^2+\\eta^2+10\\zeta^2=9$。三个主系数均正，故为椭球面。",
          "main_method_code": "principal_axes_transformation",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "把二次曲面写成 $X^TMX=9$。"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "求实对称矩阵 $M$ 的特征值和正交特征向量。",
              "method_code": "orthogonal_diagonalization"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "用单位特征向量组成正交矩阵 $T$ 并作主轴变换。",
              "method_code": "principal_axes_transformation"
            },
            {
              "order": 4,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "得到 $\\xi^2+\\eta^2+10\\zeta^2=9$，判定为椭球面。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
